vb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被浸湿；受潮；沾湿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80133\"><ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のおかげで<ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にぬれずにすんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">树让我没有下雨</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ねだん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">价格；价钱；费用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223033\">このラジオの<ruby>値段<rp>(</rp><rt>ねだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいくらですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这台收音机的价格是多少?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ねっしん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">热心；热情；积极；认真</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"87587\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>熱心<rp>(</rp><rt>ねっしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>小鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>ことり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にえさをやった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她急着喂鸟</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">熱</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">热；热量；发热；发烧；体温；热情；热诚；激情；狂热；热潮</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236102\">１０２゜Ｆの<ruby>熱<rp>(</rp><rt>ねつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我发烧了102度</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">寝坊</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねぼう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">睡懒觉；睡过头；爱睡懒觉的人；贪睡的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111682\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はときどき<ruby>寝坊<rp>(</rp><rt>ねぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有时候会睡过头。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8775770\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">眠い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねむい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">困倦的；打瞌睡的；昏昏欲睡的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201962\">テレビを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ているとすぐ<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在看电视的时候很容易睡着</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">眠る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねむる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">睡眠；入睡；死亡；长眠；安息；闲置；未被利用；未被开发；闭眼；合眼</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"237325\">もし<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るといけないので<ruby>目覚<rp>(</rp><rt>めざま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>時計<rp>(</rp><rt>どけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をセットしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">万一你睡了,就设置警报器</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">残る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のこる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">留下；剩下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">残</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">のど</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喉咙；咽喉；歌喉；嗓音；（印刷）订口；装订侧内白边</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198567\">のどがヒリヒリします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的喉咙灼痛。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗り換える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のりかえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">换乘；转乘（火车、公交等）；改变；转换；转向（思想、党派、公司等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124179\"><ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>駅<rp>(</rp><rt>えき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>列車<rp>(</rp><rt>れっしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>換<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在东京车站换火车</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗り物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のりもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">车辆；交通工具；运输工具；游乐设施；游乐项目</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146171\"><ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>向<rp>(</rp><rt>む</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">车里的骑兵是给孩子的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">葉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">は</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">叶；叶片；（松树的）针叶；叶状体；叶丛</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224180\">こちらには<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きなハスの<ruby>葉<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们有大莲花叶</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">拝見</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はいけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（谦让语）看；拜读；拜观</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198077\">パスポートを<ruby>拝見<rp>(</rp><rt>はいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我能看看你的护照吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">歯医者</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はいしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">牙医；牙科医生</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214781\">すぐ<ruby>歯医者<rp>(</rp><rt>はいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てもらいなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你最好马上去看牙医</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">運ぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はこぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">搬运；运输；移动；传送；来；去；使用（毛笔、筷子等）；运用；进行；执行；安排；进展顺利；进展；进行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169115\"><ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすらすらと<ruby>運<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">工作进展顺利。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">始める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はじめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">开始（他动）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">始</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">はず</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">应该；必然；势必；弓弭；弓两端挂弦的凹口；箭尾槽；箭扣（箭尾扣弦处）；（相扑）筈手；张开拇指与食指以虎口抵住对手的手形；日本船桅顶端防止缆绳脱落的木制框架</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199940\">トムは<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもここに<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るはずです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">汤姆随时会到</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:恥ずかしい\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">恥ずかしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はずかしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">害羞的；难为情的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うのは<ruby>恥<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずかしいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在人前唱歌很难为情。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">はっきり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">清楚地；明白地；明确地；明确；清楚；确定；准确；变清楚；变清晰</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158888\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだはっきりとは<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我还不确定</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">発音</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はつおん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">发音；声音产生；发声</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233569\">あなたのお<ruby>名前<rp>(</rp><rt>なまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどのように<ruby>発音<rp>(</rp><rt>はつおん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你怎么称呼你的名字?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">花見</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はなみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">赏樱花；赏花</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186587\"><ruby>花見<rp>(</rp><rt>はなみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ができる<ruby>春<rp>(</rp><rt>はる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>待<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>遠<rp>(</rp><rt>どお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我迫不及待地等春天到来 这样我们就可以坐在樱桃树下</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">林</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はやし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">林木；树林；森林；小树林；灌木丛；一束；一簇；一排；集合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75660\"><ruby>林<rp>(</rp><rt>はやし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>竹<rp>(</rp><rt>たけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>目立<rp>(</rp><rt>めだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">竹子在树林里很显眼</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">払う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はらう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">支付（如金钱、账单等）；拂去；擦去；清除；掸去；砍断（如树枝）；赶走；驱逐（如竞争对手）；变卖；卖掉；处理（不需要的东西）；给予；表示（如注意力、尊重、关切）；付出；花费；耗费（如努力、牺牲）；搬出；腾出（自己的住处）；扫（如腿）；挥开；推开；（书法）写出撇、捺等扫笔；（算盘）清盘；复位</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215834\">ジャックはブラシで<ruby>上着<rp>(</rp><rt>うわぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のほこりを<ruby>払<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">杰克刷了他的外套上的灰尘</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">反対</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はんたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">反对；抵抗；对抗；敌意；异议；反对意见；反面；相反；反向；相对</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221976\">この<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えには<ruby>反対<rp>(</rp><rt>はんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せざるをえない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我必须反对这个想法。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ハンドバッグ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">手提包；女用手袋</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159083\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はハンドバッグをひったくられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我被抢了我的钱包。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">場合</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばあい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">情况；场合；情形；状况</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216182\">システムが<ruby>作動<rp>(</rp><rt>さどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しない<ruby>場合<rp>(</rp><rt>ばあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有些情况系统不运行。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">倍</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">两倍；双倍；倍；倍数；n分之一；n分之一的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230998\">あの<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の５<ruby>倍<rp>(</rp><rt>ばい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那座山是这座山的五倍</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:場所\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">場所</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地方；场所</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まる<ruby>場所<rp>(</rp><rt>ばしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请告诉我集合的地方。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">番組</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばんぐみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（电视等）节目；电视节目</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"171263\"><ruby>今晩<rp>(</rp><rt>こんばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>どんな<ruby>番組<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんぐみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">今晚有什么节目?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パソコン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">个人计算机；个人电脑；PC</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"2869687\">パソコンが<ruby>起動<rp>(</rp><rt>きどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなくなりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的电脑不会再启动了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">部分；兼职员工；临时工；兼职；兼职工作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210043\">その<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は２つのパートに<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">考试分为两部分。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">天；日子；太阳；阳光；白天；日间；白昼；日期；截止日期；（过去的）岁月；时光；情况；事件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124386\"><ruby>冬<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>づくにつれて<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>短<rp>(</rp><rt>みじか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">随着冬天的到来,日子越来越短。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">火</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">火；火焰；火苗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229095\">いすをもっと<ruby>火<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くに<ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把椅子拉近火堆</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变冷；冷却；凉爽</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77675\"><ruby>冷<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えたビールがあればたまらないね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冷啤酒会打到现场!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">光</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひかり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">光；光亮；光线；光束；闪光；光辉；幸福；希望；影响；权势；视力；视觉；光纤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174089\"><ruby>光<rp>(</rp><rt>ひかり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>世<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にやって<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">光明已降临世界。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">光る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">发光；闪耀；明亮</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174071\"><ruby>光<rp>(</rp><rt>ひか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るものすべてが<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>きん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">闪光点不是金子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">引き出し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひきだし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抽屉；提取；取款；应变知识；临机应变的本领</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225748\">きれいなタオルは<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しにありますよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">干净的毛巾在抽屉里</span></div></li>"]